note: JSON-LD vocabulary. @graph holds rdfs:Class (18), rdf:Property (106), skos:ConceptScheme (8),
      skos:Concept (113). @ids are CURIEs and are the native stableIds (stableUriPropertyName = 'uri').
      Native namespaces: qdata, metricCat, schema, adminRecord, collectionMethod, dataWithholding,
      demoCat, incomeDetermination, sourceCoverage, subjectCategory, skos. schema:* is NATIVE for QData
      (schema:MonetaryAmount / MonetaryAmountDistribution / QuantitativeValue as classes; schema:value /
      currency / minValue / maxValue / unitText / about / description as properties — all emitted).
      The 31 ceterms:* terms (7 classes incl ceterms:Credential + 24 properties) are CTDL-overlap:
      FILTERED (not emitted); native references to them are stashed as {system:'ctdl', ...} crossRefs, and
      references to CTDL-ASN terms (ceasn:/asn:) as {system:'ctdlasn', ...} crossRefs (standard-pure — no
      cross-standard node or edge). xsd:*/rdf:*/rdfs:*/dct:* datatype+annotation endpoints are dropped.
      Zero CEDS anchors.
